Hi Michael,
Thank you for the update. Can you please share your call of cameraOperation()? The probably has to to do with argument dateFormat in cameraOperation.
In the table you shared, the dates are in DD/MM/YYYY format.
You could try to define dateFormat with the new functionality of using the lubridate package to define dates (since version1.2). For details see the vignette  <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/ImageOrganisation.html#date-format>or ?cameraOperation.
In short, use

dateFormat = "dmy"

or (the traditional way)

dateFormat = "%d/%m/%Y"

Does this help?
Best regards,
Jürgen

